## 📊 Dataset Preparation

### Dataset Structure

Organize your fundus images into class-wise folders:

```
Dataset/
├── Diabetic Retinopathy/
│   ├── image1.jpg
│   ├── image2.jpg
│   └── ...
├── Glaucoma/
│   ├── image1.jpg
│   └── ...
├── Macular Scar/
│   └── ...
└── Healthy/
    └── ...
```

### Important Notes

- Supported formats: `.jpg`, `.jpeg`, `.png`, `.bmp`
- Images will be automatically resized to 224×224
- The pipeline will automatically create stratified train/val/test splits (70/15/15)

