## 🎮 Usage

### Basic Usage

Run the complete pipeline:

```bash
python main.py --skip-unet
```

### Command-Line Arguments

```bash
python main.py --help

Arguments:
  --skip-unet        Skip U-Net training (use preprocessed images directly)
  --epochs N         Number of training epochs (default: 100)
